cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference Ghostkey in research or documentation, cite it as below."
title: "Ghostkey: local foreground-activity telemetry dashboard"
abstract: >-
  Ghostkey is a Windows desktop utility that samples the foreground application
  and visible window title, records transitions and approximate per-application
  usage, and optionally relays a session report to a configured Telegram chat.
type: software
